#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:1 7333b36181284e0b82facbdd997f6d79
msgid "Spectral & time-frequency"
msgstr "スペクトル・時間周波数"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:3 5bd5d4c0baef4db1b069f5c3ce2130ed
msgid ""
"Spectrogram conditioning, Hilbert-Huang, peak detection and method "
"comparison."
msgstr "スペクトログラムの整形、ヒルベルト・ファン、ピーク検出、手法比較。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:9 db3c4af3df7a4fb2a2097bc96dd697a9
msgid "Spectrogram: Normalization and Cleaning"
msgstr "スペクトログラム: 正規化とクリーニング"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:13 a926d140001741859e0d98f1d4d5b230
msgid ""
"Convert raw spectrogram power to SNR or relative units, then remove lines "
"and artifacts with `clean()`."
msgstr "スペクトログラムの生のパワーを SNR や相対単位に変換し、`clean()` でラインやアーティファクトを除去します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:16 f8147162dd844c35ae730fce4517beaf
msgid "HHT: Analysis"
msgstr "HHT: 解析"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:20 e68974e3c4bd408eb8f14ff6e001983e
msgid ""
"Hilbert-Huang Transform for nonlinear, non-stationary signals and "
"instantaneous frequency extraction."
msgstr "非線形・非定常な信号のためのヒルベルト・ファン変換と瞬時周波数の抽出。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:23 4b836287d73a464c98069443f3e5d9fc
msgid "Peak Detection: Finding Peaks"
msgstr "ピーク検出: ピークを見つける"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:27 e05093def45c476d963eac0eda2bcb44
msgid ""
"Detect peaks in `TimeSeries` / `FrequencySeries` with physical-unit "
"constraints on distance, height, and width."
msgstr "`TimeSeries` / `FrequencySeries` でピークを検出し、間隔・高さ・幅を物理単位で制約します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:30 85db85b69b3f479caef92a16543c4ce1
msgid "Peak Tracking: Time Evolution"
msgstr "ピーク追跡: 時間変化の解析"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:34 1a124576af9b4e96a546725521ca95f2
msgid ""
"Follow a spectral line through time across a spectrogram, e.g. drifting "
"power-line harmonics or violin modes."
msgstr "スペクトログラム上でスペクトルラインを時間方向に追跡します（電源ラインの高調波の周波数ドリフトやバイオリンモードなど）。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:37 80b419e548354157b1c2863f66556010
msgid "Time-Frequency Analysis: Interactive Comparison"
msgstr "時間周波数解析: インタラクティブ比較"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/index.md:41 6a563fad88a94df5875f565faeae66a9
msgid ""
"Compare STFT and Q-transform baselines against other time-frequency methods "
"and see when each is the right choice."
msgstr "STFT と Q 変換をベースラインとして他の時間周波数手法と比較し、どの手法をいつ選ぶべきかを確認します。"
